SUMMARY:Build Digital Recap: English (AMER/EMEA)
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\n[Microsoft Build](https://build.mic
 rosoft.com) introduces us to what’s next. This session focuses on what i
 t means for you.\n\nJoin us for a curated walkthrough of the most relevant
  Build announcements\, translated into practical\, regionally relevant ins
 ights. Hear perspectives from GitHub\, DevRel\, and local leaders on how t
 o apply these innovations in real-world scenarios—and what developers sh
 ould prioritize next.\n\nLeave with a clear view of what matters\, what to
  watch\, and how to turn Build momentum into action.\n\nThis session is a 
 part of a series\, learn more [here](https://developer.microsoft.com/react
 or/series/S-1679/?wt.mc_id=meetup_27266_webpage_reactor)
