SUMMARY:Stop Lurking\, Start Connecting: You Belong In the Microsoft Data 
 & AI Communitie
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nEveryone talks about community. Thi
 s session shows you how to actually get started\, grow your presence\, and
  turn it into something real.\n\nDiscover how to connect in the Microsoft 
 Fabric\, SQL\, Power BI and AI communities and beyond\, meet people on the
  same journey\, make some friends\, and start building momentum with thing
 s that are actually fun to do.\n\nWe’ll break down simple ways to get in
 volved\, grow your presence\, and turn small steps into real momentum. Whe
 ther you're just starting or already active\, this is where connection bec
 omes progress.\n\nPre-requisites:\nFind ways to connect: https://aka.ms/dd
 /connect\nSee what else is happening during Data Days: https://aka.ms/data
 days
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/microsoft-reactor-toronto/events/3153
 33232/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260619T194858Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260619T194858Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Microsoft Reactor Toronto
UID:event_315333862@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
